Initial public snapshot
-----------------------

The initial public source snapshot is based on the locally verified Panthera
checkpoint 265de5cfddcbd63ac7505e7cdb5594460321ed08, with this notice bundle,
restored/corrected source notices, and the project README. That identifier is
an internal provenance reference, not an ancestor of the public repository.

The public snapshot intentionally has no inherited development history:
older local ancestry contains unrelated project data and generated binaries.
Local history remains intact. No claim is made that those historical binaries
have completed a redistribution audit.

The optional vendor/usertemplate-109 payload and unused montecarlo_font.c
are excluded from the public snapshot because an authoritative redistribution
grant was not established during publication review. Their omission is not a
claim that they are proprietary. The active console font is Tamzen. The
uncommitted R3.2 pkgsrc experiments, downloaded source caches, VM images,
private development artifacts, and generated executables are not published.

The source and history checks found no confirmed live provider credentials or
actual private-key payloads in the approved source snapshot. This is not a
security certification: development guest account defaults and network
exposure remain unsafe for untrusted environments; see README.md.

See docs/provenance/PROVENANCE.md, docs/provenance/THIRD_PARTY.md, and
docs/provenance/APPLE_PATCHES.md for component intake and modification records.
The inventory is not a blanket
legal opinion or a claim that arbitrary built images are redistribution-ready.
